## 5. True Normal Quotient

At `[F]`, the tangent space to the full eta9 projective coefficient space has
rank 248. The exact projective sequence is

```text
0 -> K/span(F) -> V/span(F) -> R -> 0,
     rank 122       rank 248    rank 126.
```

Thus the true graph-incidence normal quotient has rank 126, not 215. The old
33-slice quotient has the exact filtration

```text
0 -> (K/span(F))/L_33 -> (V/span(F))/L_33 -> R -> 0,
             rank 89             rank 215       rank 126.
```

Equivalently,

```text
